Z||000019||JSocha||10-06-2001||11:13 PM||||God is walking down the sidewalk of a busy business district.<P>As he is walking, he comes across three little orphan boys sitting on the curb, heads in their hands crying very hard.<P>God approaches the first liitle boy, bends over and asks, what is wrong my son.<P>The boy shares with God that he has been blind since birth, and nobody wants to adopt him because of this.<P>God puts his healing hands on the boys face covering his eyes for a moment, pulls them away and the boy can now see perfectly.  The little boy gets up, quickly thanks God and runs happily away.<P>God then goes over to and bends over to ask the second little boy why he is crying.<P>The boy hears God's voice and replies that he has been deaf since birth and nobody wants to adopt a deaf boy as they think they are dumb.<P>God once again places his hands on the side of the second boys face, covering his ears for a few moments, pulls his hands away, and the boy can now hear all the beautiful sounds around him.  He to gets up, thanks God and runs away with joy.<P>God once again stands up and goes over to the third little boy, who as well is cyring his little heart out like the other two.<P>"My son," what is the matter.<P>The boy replies, "You can't help me."<P>God reasures the little boy that since he is God and was able to help the other two little boys by making the first one see and the second one hear, that there is no problem that he can not fix.<P>With that, the little boy replied, "I'm Norweigen."<P>God looked at the boy for a moment, sat down next to him on the curb, put his own head into the palms of his own hands and started to cry along side the little boy.||||reg||10
